---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const title = "Privacy Policy: How Toolkit Lab Handles Your Data";
const description = "How Toolkit Lab handles your data: our tools work on your device, what cookies and advertising partners may collect, and how to opt out.";
---
<Base title={title} description={description} path="/privacy">
<div class="wrap">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="note">Last updated: 26 October 2026</p>

      <h2>Your files and text</h2>
      <p>The tools on this site process your images, text and JSON in your browser. This content is not sent to our servers and we do not store it.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
      <p>This site uses Google AdSense to show ads. Google and its partners may use cookies to show ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">adssettings.google.com</a>. Learn how Google uses data at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener" target="_blank">policies.google.com</a>.</p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>If we use analytics tools in future, this policy will be updated to say so.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, use the <a href="contact">contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>

</Base>
